; HELLO.DEF -- module-definition file for HELLO.C (Windows 3.x)

NAME         HELLO
DESCRIPTION  'Hello, Windows! for Windows 3.x'
EXETYPE      WINDOWS
STUB         'WINSTUB.EXE'
CODE         PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA         PRELOAD MOVEABLE MULTIPLE
HEAPSIZE     1024
STACKSIZE    8192
EXPORTS      WndProc
